# Frontend env. Copy to mydiary-vuetify/.env (gitignored) and fill in.
#
# Vite only exposes variables to browser code when they start with VITE_, and
# the frontend container can't see backend/.env, which is why the CARTO key is
# declared here a second time. It isn't really a secret -- it goes out with
# every tile request the browser makes, and CARTO scopes it by domain.
#
# Optional. Without it the map still draws, with "API KEY REQUIRED" watermarked
# across the tiles. Free, no account needed: https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey/
#
# Must match CARTO_BASEMAP_KEY in backend/.env, or the browser map and the
# rendered map images will disagree about whether they're watermarked.
#
# A git worktree does not need its own copy: scripts/bootstrap-worktree.sh
# symlinks this file from the primary checkout.
VITE_CARTO_BASEMAP_KEY=
